		"description": "<p><em>Toolbelt upgrade of your <strong>Tool Wrench</strong> gadget — use this instead of the gadget item to activate it with the greater effect for 2 Toolbelt scraps total.</em></p><p><em>Gadget — A trusty wrench that doubles as a turret recall tool.</em></p><p><strong>1 Action · Considered a mace.</strong> Reach 1, Damage: 1d6+STR Bludgeoning. If you target your turret, you undeploy it and regain its Toolbelt scrap.</p><p><strong>Toolbelt:</strong> Target is Dazed, 3 turns, or the turret lasts +3 rounds.</p><p><strong>Passive:</strong> Turrets can be Tiny.</p><hr><p><em>[A] Spends 2 Toolbelt scraps — tracked on the sheet (click the counter to correct mistakes).</em></p><p><em>[A] Rolls 1d6+STR Bludgeoning; on hit the target is Dazed.</em></p><p><em>[M] Dazed lasts 3 turns. If you target your turret instead, it lasts +3 rounds (no damage — ignore the roll).</em></p>",
